abstract: >-
  Evolution by Emergence is an open research corpus and machine-auditable
  candidate architecture for resource-constrained cumulative evolution.
  Version v22.1 adds a single front door to the core dynamic: CORE.md states
  the vortex loop on one page (ledger, ratchet, vortex, speed, network, and
  the boundaries that cannot be dropped), and
  formalization/ebe-core/EbECore.lean collects and audits the 37
  machine-checked results that carry it, usable as a Lean dependency. It also
  adds a network ledger separating creation from transfer inside the vortex.
  The v22.0 universal core and intelligent-system specialization are retained
  unchanged. The release title uses "simulation of reality" to mean the
  internal model through which a system experiences and acts in the world, not
  a claim that reality itself is simulated. Formal verification establishes
  implications under explicit premises; empirical, causal, political and
  normative interpretations remain open.
keywords:
